{
  "description": "AI extraction evaluation set (package 13c). Synthetic invoices only: fictional seeded vendors, bank code 00000000. Each case states what the PDF shows and what the whole pipeline (extraction, rules, matching) must end with. The PDFs next to this file are generated from it: dotnet run --project tests/EInvoice.AiEvaluation -- generate",
